[Init]

[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Hectic</h2>
The Lord of <?{vn_windall}>Wind</?><?!{vn_windall}>Rain</?>~. has been slain by the People's Front of Nimbus.
 Or was it the Nimbian People's Front? Or maybe The People's Friends of Nimbus? Anyway, they must all die. Due to your excellent performance in battle you are crowned as the new leader of <?{vn_windall}>Wind</?><?!{vn_windall}>Rain</?>~., 
and it is up to you to secure this strategically vital area of the Pyroshpere, Storm Pass
<p>~rWARNING~. This mission has eight people on it, so it's prone to crashing occasionally. Don't press escape or F9 or anything like that either.

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[ai1PriestCaptured]
<h2>Your priest is captured.
 Fearing your great power your opponents quickly slaughter you rather then sacrifice you for knowledge.</h2>
<p>
<$Config,vn_death=1>
<$Config,vn_alive=0>
$Button=Leave,tell,guidevn.overview


