[ai8PriestDead]
Your ally died. This was a big battle and he could have been very helpful. With a heavy heart you valiantly battle on.

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Incredible!</h2>
<p>
You have been victorious in an eight priest bloodbath!
 Nimbus is falling under your control. All that needs be done now is to kill the leaders of the other two furies.....

